      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}, thank you for getting back to me. Yes, this issue is still present. VRChat is gone from Nvidia Shadowplay. Only downgrading the drivers (and GeForce experience) will make it work again. I don't know how you got on the supported games list in the first place, but can you try to bring the game back? Even when not on the official supported games list by Nvidia, ShadowPlay is not able to grab output out of the game window - simply not recognizing it as a game.\n\nI do not know whether there is something you guys can do with the game itself (Unity Player). I also don't know whether any changes introduced in VRChat that caused this. Maybe the Unity 2022 branch will magically fix it?\n\nEdit: nah, also still present on open beta 1346",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
