      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This issue has been partially resolved by Nvidia. With the sunset of the GeForce experience, they now allow to opt into the replacement: \"Nvidia App\". Unlike the GeForce Experience, the \"Nvidia App\" allows you to add any executable to the games list (not only the ones supported by Nvidia for optimization) and thus to record with ShadowPlay. Make sure to add VRChat.exe, and you're good to go.",
