  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hi there,\nI noticed that since around May, it is not possible to record the window output of VRChat with Nvidia ShadowPlay anymore. Also the game disappeared from the supported games list in the GeForce Experience. (Windows 10 21H2 + RTX 3080)\nA workaround is to record the whole desktop instead, but this is cumbersome, since you cannot use the Desktop whilst recording (window overlay) and you have to edit out the rest of the desktop in post - or play VRChat in full screen mode.\nIs there a reason as to why the support for game window recording with ShadowPlay got dropped?\nIs this something within the sphere of influence of the VRChat Developers? (being a supported game in GeForce Experience).",
